== 1. the assistant's own token (client credentials)
POST /realms/harbor/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Basic <client_id:client_secret>

grant_type=client_credentials

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
cache-control: no-store
content-type: application/json

{
  "access_token": "<JWT 758 chars>",
  "expires_in": 300,
  "refresh_expires_in": 0,
  "token_type": "Bearer",
  "not-before-policy": 0,
  "scope": ""
}

== 2. token exchange: Rosa's token in, a delegated token out
POST /realms/harbor/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
DPoP: <JWT 508 chars>
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Basic <client_id:client_secret>

grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange&
subject_token=<JWT 1275 chars>&
subject_token_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:access_token&
actor_token=<JWT 758 chars>&
actor_token_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:access_token&
scope=orders:read

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
cache-control: no-store
content-type: application/json

{
  "access_token": "<JWT 1062 chars>",
  "expires_in": 299,
  "refresh_expires_in": 0,
  "token_type": "DPoP",
  "not-before-policy": 0,
  "scope": "orders:read",
  "issued_token_type": "urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:access_token"
}
{
  "exp": 1794385798,
  "iss": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/realms/harbor",
  "aud": "http://127.0.0.1:8008",
  "sub": "3a03a554-5de5-45c1-bcdf-efb8db42e379",
  "azp": "harbor-assistant",
  "cnf": {
    "jkt": "p109ih0pbH88_7KuT6kuOA-PwseNdaZ43vOOEd7UbrI",
    "kc-jkt-type": "DPoP"
  },
  "scope": "orders:read",
  "act": {
    "sub": "d98a6b6d-6ab0-4d09-849b-943a2baf80b9",
    "client_id": "harbor-assistant"
  },
  "customer_id": "cus-001"
}

== 3. the assistant reads Rosa's order with a fresh proof
GET /orders/ord-5003 HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8008
Authorization: DPoP <JWT 1062 chars>
DPoP: <JWT 539 chars>

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: application/json

{
  "id": "ord-5003",
  "customer_id": "cus-001",
  "status": "paid",

== 4. a thief with the token but not the key
GET /orders/ord-5003 HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8008
Authorization: Bearer <JWT 1062 chars>

HTTP/1.1 401 Unauthorized
content-type: application/problem+json
www-authenticate: DPoP resource_metadata="http://127.0.0.1:8008/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource", error="invalid_token", error_description="DPoP-bound token sent without a DPoP proof", algs="ES256"

{
  "type": "https://harbor.example/problems/unauthorized",
  "title": "Unauthorized",
  "status": 401,
  "detail": "DPoP-bound token sent without a DPoP proof"
}

replayed proof: 401 proof already used

== 5. the delegated token tries to cancel the order
403 DPoP resource_metadata="http://127.0.0.1:8008/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource", error="insufficient_scope", error_description="PUT /orders/ord-5003/cancellation needs orders:write", scope="orders:write", algs="ES256"
